    <briefdescription>
<para>A counted region, checked when the enclosing scope ends. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The C++ form of Python&apos;s <computeroutput>with stream.check_nbytes():</computeroutput>: bind the guard and the region is checked at the end of the block.</para>
<para><programlisting><codeline><highlight class="keyword">auto</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>frame<sp/>=<sp/>stream.check_nbytes();</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>...<sp/>members<sp/>...</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
<para>A mismatch throws <computeroutput>std::runtime_error</computeroutput> from the destructor, which is why it is <computeroutput>noexcept( false )</computeroutput>. A block that raised is dropped without a second exception, so the original error survives. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
